      }, {
        "text": "\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n```\n\n### How to test your new Admin Panel:\n1. Restart your server (`CTRL + C` then `python"
      }, {
        "text": " app.py`).\n2. Log in as Teacher (`T01` / `0000`).\n"
      }, {
        "text": "3. **Test the Tabs:** Click between Logs, Manage Books, and Manage Users at the top. Notice how smoothly it switches without"
      }, {
        "text": " reloading the page!\n4. **Test Adding a Book:** Go to Books tab, add ID `B02` and"
      }, {
        "text": " Title `Harry Potter`. It will immediately appear in the table.\n5. **Test Adding a User:** Go to Users tab, add a"
      }, {
        "text": " new student.\n6. **Test Deleting a User:** Try to delete your own account (T01). The"
      }, {
        "text": " \"Delete\" button should be hidden, and it should just say \"(You)\"! \n7. **Test Manual Log:** Go to Logs"
      }, {
