      "parts": [{
        "text": "This is a **Jinja syntax error**! Sometimes"
      }, {
        "text": ", when Jinja template tags (like `{% if %}`) are placed on the exact same line as HTML tags ("
      }, {
        "text": "like `\u003ca\u003e`), Python gets confused during the copy-paste process or your code editor accidentally auto-completes an extra"
      }, {
        "text": " `\u003e` character.\n\nLet\u0027s fix this by separating the Jinja tags from the HTML tags onto their own lines.\n\n"
      }, {
        "text": "### How to fix it:\nOpen your `teacher.html` file and look around **Line 68-"
      }, {
        "text": "71**. \n\nFind this block of code:\n```html\n        \u003cform action\u003d\"/teacher\" method\u003d\"POST\" class\u003d\""
      }, {
        "text": "form-inline\" style\u003d\"border-left-color: #9e9e9e;\"\u003e\n            \u003clabel"
      }, {
        "text": "\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFilter Date:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\n            \u003cinput type\u003d\"date\" name\u003d\"selected_date\" value"
      }, {
        "text": "\u003d\"{{ selected_date }}\"\u003e\n            \u003cbutton type\u003d\"submit\" class\u003d\"btn-blue\"\u003eFilter\u003c/button\u003e\n"
      }, {
        "text": "            {% if selected_date %\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/teacher\" class\u003d\"btn-gray\"\u003eShow All\u003c/a\u003e{% endif"
      }, {
        "text": " %}\n        \u003c/form\u003e\n```\n\n**Replace that entire block with this spaced-out version:**\n```html\n        \u003cform"
      }, {
        "text": " action\u003d\"/teacher\" method\u003d\"POST\" class\u003d\"form-inline\" style\u003d\"border-left-color: #9"
      }, {
        "text": "e9e9e;\"\u003e\n            \u003clabel\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFilter Date:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\n            \u003cinput type"
      }, {
        "text": "\u003d\"date\" name\u003d\"selected_date\" value\u003d\"{{ selected_date }}\"\u003e\n            \u003cbutton type\u003d\"submit\" class"
      }, {
        "text": "\u003d\"btn-blue\"\u003eFilter\u003c/button\u003e\n            \n            {% if selected_date %}\n                \u003ca href"
      }, {
        "text": "\u003d\"/teacher\" class\u003d\"btn-gray\"\u003eShow All\u003c/a\u003e\n            {% endif %}\n            \n        \u003c/form\u003e"
      }, {
        "text": "\n```\n\n### Try testing again:\n1. Save `teacher.html`.\n2. You **do not** need to restart"
      }, {
        "text": " the Python server when you only change HTML files! \n3. Just go to your web browser and refresh the page (`http://12"
      }, {
        "text": "7.0.0.1:5000/teacher`).\n\nIt should load perfectly now! Let me know if it"
      }, {
        "text": " displays the Admin Panel properly."
      }, {
