        "text": " can make two quick improvements to `app.py`:\n1. We will update the database query so the Books table automatically groups identical titles"
      }, {
        "text": " together alphabetically.\n2. We will add a strict \"check\" before adding a book, so if they accidentally scan the same barcode twice"
      }, {
