        "text": "**Defining the Objective**\n\nI\u0027m currently focused on defining the project\u0027s core objective – crafting a `README.md` file for the LSMS GitHub repository. I\u0027ve broken down the project name to ensure I\u0027m using the right acronym for the Simple Library System for Mother\u0027s School project. I\u0027ve begun to consider the elements to include.\n\n\n",
