      }, {
        "text": "**Outlining the Tech**\n\nI\u0027ve moved on to fleshing out the tech stack and project features. I have decided to highlight the key components: Python, Flask, SQLite, vanilla HTML/CSS/JS, and LINE Messaging API. I\u0027m focusing on features like role-based access, borrow/return functions, auto-logout, the admin panel, Thai translation, and LINE notifications. I am also working on showcasing the project\u0027s folder structure, per the provided information. I must be sure to make note of the exclusion of the installation details.\n\n\n",
